1
00:00:01,211 --> 00:00:04,247
Do you know about Jun Seo and Eun Seo?

2
00:00:04,838 --> 00:00:06,875
They love each other.

3
00:00:06,875 --> 00:00:08,231
They are in love.

4
00:00:09,843 --> 00:00:11,654
Jun Seo, you...

5
00:00:12,914 --> 00:00:13,942
You...

6
00:00:14,810 --> 00:00:17,380
Dad, no.

7
00:00:17,380 --> 00:00:19,139
It's not his fault.

8
00:00:19,139 --> 00:00:20,539
I'm the one who loves him.

9
00:00:20,539 --> 00:00:21,885
He doesn't love me back.

10
00:00:24,756 --> 00:00:27,501
What does this all mean?

11
00:00:28,705 --> 00:00:29,705
Jun Seo.

12
00:00:31,882 --> 00:00:32,882
Is it true?

13
00:00:38,776 --> 00:00:39,776
Yes.

14
00:00:48,297 --> 00:00:51,954
(Episode 9)

15
00:01:02,360 --> 00:01:04,052
Why did you do that?

16
00:01:06,001 --> 00:01:08,320
You should've told them it was not true.

17
00:01:10,116 --> 00:01:11,159
Well?

18
00:01:14,413 --> 00:01:16,014
I didn't want to lie.

19
00:01:16,676 --> 00:01:17,767
Jun Seo.

20
00:01:19,205 --> 00:01:20,241
Eun Seo.

21
00:01:28,796 --> 00:01:29,840
We should leave.

22
00:02:04,342 --> 00:02:05,383
Eun Seo.

23
00:02:07,724 --> 00:02:08,783
Choi Eun Seo.

24
00:02:13,628 --> 00:02:14,663
Eun Seo.

25
00:02:16,118 --> 00:02:17,208
Choi Eun Seo.

26
00:02:20,964 --> 00:02:21,999
Thank you.

27
00:02:57,316 --> 00:02:59,886
What do you mean they left?

28
00:03:01,731 --> 00:03:03,038
I am not sure.

29
00:03:04,147 --> 00:03:05,893
What do you mean?

30
00:03:07,556 --> 00:03:11,312
Tae Seok, tell me. What did you mean?

31
00:03:11,312 --> 00:03:12,665
What do you mean?

32
00:03:14,976 --> 00:03:18,650
Are you saying they ran away?

33
00:03:25,119 --> 00:03:26,119
Eun Seo.

34
00:03:29,240 --> 00:03:30,403
Eun Seo.

35
00:03:31,824 --> 00:03:33,018
Eun Seo.

36
00:03:34,751 --> 00:03:36,083
Eun Seo.

37
00:04:10,260 --> 00:04:13,015
Give me the key. I'll drive.

38
00:04:27,712 --> 00:04:29,303
They'll be back soon.

39
00:04:31,012 --> 00:04:33,264
They probably have so much on their minds.

40
00:04:33,860 --> 00:04:35,614
They ran away? That's nonsense.

41
00:04:36,469 --> 00:04:41,041
So, don't worry, Tae Seok. All right?

42
00:04:44,988 --> 00:04:47,559
Their parents were in shock.

43
00:04:48,564 --> 00:04:51,783
They could've talked tomorrow
if they had had to.

44
00:04:51,783 --> 00:04:52,802
Stop it.

45
00:04:55,320 --> 00:04:56,415
Stop.

46
00:04:58,979 --> 00:05:00,222
Stop talking, please.

47
00:05:48,507 --> 00:05:49,679
Choi Eun Seo.

48
00:05:51,212 --> 00:05:52,256
Eun Seo.

49
00:05:57,051 --> 00:05:58,333
Choi Eun Seo.

50
00:06:00,451 --> 00:06:01,854
Choi Eun Seo.

51
00:06:16,883 --> 00:06:18,734
Choi Eun Seo.

52
00:06:54,725 --> 00:06:57,744
Do you regret it?

53
00:06:59,492 --> 00:07:02,550
No, I don't.

54
00:07:15,636 --> 00:07:16,839
Can I sleep?

55
00:07:20,070 --> 00:07:21,359
Can I go to sleep?

56
00:07:24,109 --> 00:07:26,366
Don't go anywhere, okay?

57
00:07:40,919 --> 00:07:44,618
I think we'll get punished.

58
00:07:49,990 --> 00:07:51,145
Don't worry.

59
00:07:52,847 --> 00:07:54,233
I'll take whatever is coming to us.

60
00:07:57,262 --> 00:07:59,177
I'll get punished for us both, Eun Seo.

61
00:08:33,533 --> 00:08:34,712
What can I do?

62
00:08:36,501 --> 00:08:37,738
What should I do?

63
00:08:40,494 --> 00:08:41,647
He's not here.

64
00:08:42,607 --> 00:08:44,627
Jun Seo is not here.

65
00:08:46,045 --> 00:08:47,721
He is nowhere.

66
00:08:51,510 --> 00:08:54,991
What can I do if they really ran away?

67
00:08:58,918 --> 00:09:00,776
What should I do?

68
00:09:44,035 --> 00:09:46,125
(Off)

69
00:09:58,671 --> 00:09:59,671
Here we go.

70
00:10:00,402 --> 00:10:02,124
- Enjoy.
- Thanks.

71
00:10:25,459 --> 00:10:26,573
Eat up.

72
00:11:47,492 --> 00:11:49,706
Right, is that so?

73
00:11:49,706 --> 00:11:51,650
How is your mother?

74
00:11:51,650 --> 00:11:52,953
She is well.

75
00:11:52,953 --> 00:11:54,746
You have not changed at all.

76
00:11:54,746 --> 00:11:57,844
Nonsense, I got really old.

77
00:11:58,955 --> 00:12:00,011
By the way...

78
00:12:02,690 --> 00:12:03,756
Who is he?

79
00:12:05,521 --> 00:12:06,521
He is...

80
00:12:09,738 --> 00:12:12,952
You are lucky I have a vacant room.

81
00:12:12,952 --> 00:12:16,689
It is a humble room,
but I hope you don't mind.

82
00:12:16,689 --> 00:12:19,305
I like it.

83
00:12:19,305 --> 00:12:20,505
Thank you.

84
00:12:20,505 --> 00:12:22,529
Thank you so much.

85
00:12:22,529 --> 00:12:24,197
You're very welcome.

86
00:12:30,540 --> 00:12:31,589
This is good.

87
00:12:35,716 --> 00:12:38,208
But I think it feels empty somehow.

88
00:12:38,208 --> 00:12:39,537
Why don't we go and buy things?

89
00:12:41,565 --> 00:12:42,565
Sure.

90
00:12:53,123 --> 00:12:55,484
What is that for? Is it for me?

91
00:12:56,482 --> 00:12:58,939
I've never picked up men's clothes.

92
00:12:58,939 --> 00:13:02,193
I have no idea. You choose.

93
00:13:02,193 --> 00:13:04,346
No, you pick one for me.

94
00:13:05,176 --> 00:13:08,399
You dress well.
I don't know what style you like.

95
00:13:08,399 --> 00:13:10,951
I'll wear whatever you choose from now on.

96
00:13:10,951 --> 00:13:12,451
So, pick one for me.

97
00:13:19,064 --> 00:13:21,084
- This one.
- What?

98
00:13:22,023 --> 00:13:23,227
Then, this is for you.

99
00:14:03,792 --> 00:14:05,681
After you left for the U.S.,

100
00:14:05,681 --> 00:14:08,266
my family came here
to run away from our debts.

101
00:14:09,727 --> 00:14:12,489
Mom worked at the farm,

102
00:14:12,489 --> 00:14:14,899
and I finished school
while helping with errands.

103
00:14:19,315 --> 00:14:20,317
Did you?

104
00:14:23,345 --> 00:14:25,244
I experienced my first love here.

105
00:14:25,993 --> 00:14:26,993
What?

106
00:14:27,551 --> 00:14:29,489
It caused much drama.

107
00:14:29,489 --> 00:14:31,851
I cried and wrote letters all the time.

108
00:14:32,672 --> 00:14:34,274
Who was he?

109
00:14:34,274 --> 00:14:35,302
That's a secret.

110
00:14:36,426 --> 00:14:38,438
I engraved names on a tree.

111
00:14:40,388 --> 00:14:41,388
Did you?

112
00:14:42,419 --> 00:14:44,493
So you did that, all right.

113
00:14:45,443 --> 00:14:47,382
- Are you jealous?
- No.

114
00:14:50,372 --> 00:14:52,063
Which tree would be a good pick?

115
00:14:56,133 --> 00:14:58,495
Engrave my name... right away.

116
00:15:04,190 --> 00:15:07,665
Jun Seo. When are we going back?

117
00:15:11,285 --> 00:15:12,896
When will we?

118
00:15:15,222 --> 00:15:18,382
It's my birthday in a few days.

119
00:15:18,382 --> 00:15:19,953
Can we go back after my birthday?

120
00:15:22,701 --> 00:15:24,445
Let me see. Today is...

121
00:15:25,833 --> 00:15:27,276
Your birthday is the day after tomorrow.

122
00:15:28,081 --> 00:15:29,292
We can't, can we?

123
00:15:30,498 --> 00:15:33,492
Everyone is probably
waiting for us to come back.

124
00:15:36,803 --> 00:15:40,204
Will they forgive us?

125
00:15:41,994 --> 00:15:43,893
I don't care.

126
00:15:43,893 --> 00:15:45,537
I don't care if they don't forgive us.

127
00:15:48,160 --> 00:15:49,586
When I came here, I gave up on everything.

128
00:15:50,927 --> 00:15:52,730
When I asked you to leave with me,
I gave up everything.

129
00:15:53,471 --> 00:15:54,530
Jun Seo.

130
00:16:01,110 --> 00:16:02,985
I left everything to be with you.

131
00:16:05,095 --> 00:16:06,889
I won't think about anything else.

132
00:16:09,727 --> 00:16:10,727
Do you get that?

133
00:16:18,287 --> 00:16:19,287
There it is.

134
00:16:20,999 --> 00:16:22,007
I found it.

135
00:16:24,573 --> 00:16:25,711
My tree.

136
00:17:21,976 --> 00:17:26,154
Eun Seo, come back.

137
00:17:30,056 --> 00:17:31,755
I'm waiting for you.

138
00:17:39,304 --> 00:17:42,168
Choi Eun Seo. Come back now.

139
00:17:42,168 --> 00:17:43,410
Have you got a death wish?

140
00:17:46,960 --> 00:17:48,554
I'll kill you for this.

141
00:18:08,048 --> 00:18:09,138
Eun Seo.

142
00:18:11,391 --> 00:18:12,665
Choi Eun Seo.

143
00:18:15,143 --> 00:18:16,801
Eun Seo.

144
00:18:16,801 --> 00:18:18,536
The mailbox is full.

145
00:18:18,536 --> 00:18:20,857
You cannot leave a message.

146
00:18:24,215 --> 00:18:25,237
Hello.

147
00:18:28,546 --> 00:18:29,708
Hello.

148
00:18:33,418 --> 00:18:35,115
I have more to say.

149
00:18:37,745 --> 00:18:39,677
I have more to say.

150
00:18:44,162 --> 00:18:45,248
I...

151
00:18:46,951 --> 00:18:48,291
have more to say.

152
00:18:55,991 --> 00:18:57,553
I love you, Eun Seo.

153
00:19:13,179 --> 00:19:14,310
Hello.

154
00:19:20,668 --> 00:19:21,825
What...

155
00:19:23,926 --> 00:19:25,905
What are you talking about?

156
00:19:27,702 --> 00:19:29,391
What do you mean Eun Seo ran away?

157
00:19:30,069 --> 00:19:33,112
Why would she run away with her brother?

158
00:19:33,112 --> 00:19:36,028
Why would she run away with Jun Seo?

159
00:19:36,550 --> 00:19:40,071
I knew she would do something...

160
00:19:40,071 --> 00:19:42,544
when he hit me, saying his Eun Seo
or whatever.

161
00:19:42,544 --> 00:19:45,906
He's not even her brother,
and she is living with him.

162
00:19:50,447 --> 00:19:51,984
All right.

163
00:19:51,984 --> 00:19:54,978
I'll go. Stop giving me that look.

164
00:19:54,978 --> 00:19:57,884
Director Han, I'll be waiting outside.

165
00:19:57,884 --> 00:19:58,948
You two can talk.

166
00:20:01,216 --> 00:20:06,348
What do you mean?

167
00:20:10,249 --> 00:20:11,540
Is it true?

168
00:20:15,194 --> 00:20:16,964
It can't be.

169
00:20:17,778 --> 00:20:20,817
He's her brother. Her brother.

170
00:20:20,817 --> 00:20:24,149
Are you sure you're not mistaken?

171
00:20:28,920 --> 00:20:30,092
Is it real?

172
00:20:35,959 --> 00:20:37,836
Is Eun Seo really...

173
00:20:37,836 --> 00:20:40,494
Don't worry. I will take care of it.

174
00:20:40,494 --> 00:20:43,026
Ms. Soon Im, please tell me.

175
00:20:44,004 --> 00:20:47,512
Do you know anywhere she might be?

176
00:20:49,206 --> 00:20:53,521
Eun Seo is with her brother...

177
00:20:55,126 --> 00:20:56,225
With her brother?

178
00:20:58,581 --> 00:21:01,886
It doesn't make sense at all.

179
00:21:06,790 --> 00:21:09,648
What is wrong with her twisted fate?

180
00:21:09,648 --> 00:21:11,919
It will be all right.
I will bring her back.

181
00:21:11,919 --> 00:21:13,108
I will bring her back...

182
00:21:15,523 --> 00:21:16,806
and get married to her.

183
00:21:18,922 --> 00:21:20,315
Everything will be okay, Ms. Soon Im.

184
00:22:05,882 --> 00:22:08,220
What do you mean by disciplinary action
against Choi Eun Seo?

185
00:22:08,220 --> 00:22:10,177
She is on vacation.

186
00:22:10,774 --> 00:22:12,647
How could she be on vacation...

187
00:22:12,647 --> 00:22:14,376
when she eloped with a man at night?

188
00:22:15,069 --> 00:22:16,184
Did you say she eloped?

189
00:22:17,158 --> 00:22:18,652
Don't you know what elope means?
Running away!

190
00:22:18,652 --> 00:22:20,190
A moonlight flit.

191
00:22:21,105 --> 00:22:23,940
If you want to defend your subordinate,
you should know better about her.

192
00:22:25,466 --> 00:22:28,099
We had better fire her.

193
00:22:29,506 --> 00:22:32,699
I heard it is an affair.

194
00:22:32,699 --> 00:22:33,957
Do you know anything about it?

195
00:22:35,579 --> 00:22:36,804
An affair?

196
00:22:39,066 --> 00:22:42,139
It doesn't make any sense.
She's such a decent girl.

197
00:22:42,139 --> 00:22:44,557
It doesn't make any sense.
He's a well-behaved man.

198
00:22:45,291 --> 00:22:48,829
They might be desperate enough
to run away.

199
00:22:50,331 --> 00:22:53,466
It seems that everyone is a mess
in their family now.

200
00:22:53,466 --> 00:22:56,244
To their parents, they are real siblings.

201
00:22:56,706 --> 00:22:59,730
But they're not related biologically.

202
00:23:00,726 --> 00:23:03,992
They also have significant others
they promised to marry.

203
00:23:04,702 --> 00:23:06,252
I know that.

204
00:23:06,252 --> 00:23:08,992
But I also knew something else.

205
00:23:10,148 --> 00:23:11,148
What did you know?

206
00:23:11,679 --> 00:23:13,577
- That this could happen.
- That they would run away?

207
00:23:16,086 --> 00:23:19,041
We seem to want it to happen.

208
00:23:20,678 --> 00:23:23,746
I'm envious of them.

209
00:23:23,746 --> 00:23:25,322
So am I.

210
00:23:25,322 --> 00:23:28,958
Not everyone has that kind of love.

211
00:24:11,660 --> 00:24:12,660
I found it.

212
00:24:13,586 --> 00:24:14,783
My tree.

213
00:24:37,563 --> 00:24:39,451
(Yoon Jun Seo, Yoon Eun Seo)

214
00:24:43,232 --> 00:24:44,971
I experienced my first love here.

215
00:24:45,601 --> 00:24:46,601
Who was he?

216
00:24:47,225 --> 00:24:48,225
That's a secret.

217
00:24:49,385 --> 00:24:51,259
I engraved names on a tree.

218
00:25:03,379 --> 00:25:04,541
Jun Seo.

219
00:25:41,419 --> 00:25:42,525
What are you doing?

220
00:25:42,525 --> 00:25:43,525
Yes?

221
00:25:45,013 --> 00:25:46,077
Isn't it pretty?

222
00:25:46,077 --> 00:25:47,280
Is this for me?

223
00:25:48,061 --> 00:25:49,079
No, it isn't.

224
00:25:50,374 --> 00:25:51,468
You are mean.

225
00:26:03,062 --> 00:26:04,874
About your first love...

226
00:26:06,141 --> 00:26:07,141
Yes?

227
00:26:08,557 --> 00:26:09,602
Never mind.

228
00:26:13,398 --> 00:26:15,531
Since when did you like me?

229
00:26:24,062 --> 00:26:26,889
It's an awkward question, isn't it?

230
00:26:29,509 --> 00:26:30,960
I'm not sure.

231
00:26:32,358 --> 00:26:33,466
What about you?

232
00:26:35,517 --> 00:26:36,960
I'm not sure, either.

233
00:26:39,038 --> 00:26:41,489
But what you said about
wanting to be a tree...

234
00:26:43,197 --> 00:26:45,344
I kept that in my mind.

235
00:26:49,245 --> 00:26:50,920
I think I'm very strong.

236
00:26:53,519 --> 00:26:57,072
Think about it.
I said I wanted to be a tree.

237
00:26:59,077 --> 00:27:01,404
If I were to take root in one place,

238
00:27:03,693 --> 00:27:06,741
I would be heartbroken
if things were to go wrong.

239
00:27:08,506 --> 00:27:11,179
I wouldn't be able to move...

240
00:27:11,179 --> 00:27:13,101
or be moved.

241
00:27:18,418 --> 00:27:21,550
If it hurts, are you going to move?

242
00:27:22,649 --> 00:27:23,649
No.

243
00:27:24,971 --> 00:27:27,390
I won't even if it hurts.

244
00:27:29,482 --> 00:27:33,565
I'll always be by your side loving you.

245
00:27:35,010 --> 00:27:37,500
Even if you won't look back at me,

246
00:27:38,834 --> 00:27:41,389
I'll live my life looking at you.

247
00:27:42,474 --> 00:27:43,525
I will.

248
00:27:54,784 --> 00:27:56,323
I'll do that, too.

249
00:27:58,762 --> 00:28:00,085
I will.

250
00:28:01,736 --> 00:28:02,942
I'll always look at you.

251
00:28:11,354 --> 00:28:12,797
Happy birthday.

252
00:28:15,890 --> 00:28:19,252
Thanks.

253
00:28:25,569 --> 00:28:26,569
Eun Seo.

254
00:28:32,200 --> 00:28:33,691
Please marry me.

255
00:29:00,064 --> 00:29:01,611
I was your first love, wasn't I?

256
00:29:23,192 --> 00:29:24,960
Mom, let me do it.

257
00:29:24,960 --> 00:29:26,019
Sit.

258
00:29:27,181 --> 00:29:28,928
You should go to work after breakfast.

259
00:29:32,517 --> 00:29:35,536
Honey, are you all right?
Can you sit up like this?

260
00:29:36,732 --> 00:29:37,767
Have a seat.

261
00:29:49,532 --> 00:29:50,681
Today is...

262
00:29:54,264 --> 00:29:56,370
Eun Seo's birthday, honey.

263
00:30:04,632 --> 00:30:06,306
What are you going to do?

264
00:30:07,136 --> 00:30:09,436
Aren't you going to do anything?

265
00:30:09,436 --> 00:30:10,844
You should report this to the police.

266
00:30:10,844 --> 00:30:12,382
Exactly what can we report to them?

267
00:30:12,877 --> 00:30:14,105
Then what?

268
00:30:15,310 --> 00:30:18,201
Are we to do nothing, without a clue
as to where they are?

269
00:30:19,957 --> 00:30:21,602
We'll wait.

270
00:30:21,602 --> 00:30:24,340
Jun Seo will come back.

271
00:30:24,340 --> 00:30:27,374
They used to be brother and sister.

272
00:30:28,172 --> 00:30:31,530
I can't let this happen.

273
00:30:31,530 --> 00:30:35,422
I can't talk about it to anyone.

274
00:30:36,692 --> 00:30:38,593
I don't know about that.

275
00:30:39,645 --> 00:30:41,020
I don't know.

276
00:30:41,020 --> 00:30:43,886
Think about it.
It is a shame on our family.

277
00:30:44,884 --> 00:30:46,278
A shame?

278
00:30:47,436 --> 00:30:49,794
Whose fault do you think this is?

279
00:30:49,794 --> 00:30:53,052
It's all because of you. It's your fault.

280
00:30:53,052 --> 00:30:56,292
You decided to leave for the U.S.
leaving Eun Seo behind.

281
00:30:56,292 --> 00:30:57,292
Honey.

282
00:30:58,940 --> 00:31:01,296
It is Eun Seo's birthday.

283
00:31:04,350 --> 00:31:05,718
It's also my birthday.

284
00:31:08,213 --> 00:31:09,253
Sin Ae.

285
00:31:09,253 --> 00:31:12,527
I knew this could happen
when Eun Seo showed up.

286
00:31:13,300 --> 00:31:15,088
I knew it.

287
00:31:16,123 --> 00:31:17,123
Sin Ae.

288
00:32:22,938 --> 00:32:24,226
Eun Seo.

289
00:32:24,226 --> 00:32:25,734
What are you doing alone?

290
00:32:26,913 --> 00:32:28,361
He went out to buy something.

291
00:32:28,361 --> 00:32:29,723
Did he?

292
00:32:30,674 --> 00:32:32,553
Eun Seo.

293
00:32:32,553 --> 00:32:34,460
You are getting married to him,
aren't you?

294
00:32:35,481 --> 00:32:36,501
Yes.

295
00:32:38,746 --> 00:32:40,529
Send my regards to your mom.

296
00:32:40,529 --> 00:32:43,651
Tell her to keep in touch, okay?

297
00:32:43,651 --> 00:32:44,674
Yes.

298
00:32:44,674 --> 00:32:45,674
Okay.

299
00:33:19,168 --> 00:33:20,260
Hello.

300
00:33:31,897 --> 00:33:33,075
Eun Seo.

301
00:33:34,799 --> 00:33:36,195
Eun Seo.

302
00:33:38,275 --> 00:33:40,293
Eun Seo.

303
00:33:53,447 --> 00:33:54,537
Hello.

304
00:33:57,200 --> 00:34:00,458
Hello.

305
00:34:01,416 --> 00:34:02,689
Hello.

306
00:34:03,631 --> 00:34:06,490
Mom, it's me.

307
00:34:08,815 --> 00:34:12,008
I called to let you know I'm fine.

308
00:34:12,429 --> 00:34:13,429
Eun Seo.

309
00:34:13,911 --> 00:34:16,049
Eun Seo, don't hang up.

310
00:34:16,049 --> 00:34:17,609
Don't hang up, Eun Seo.

311
00:34:20,559 --> 00:34:22,741
Why are you doing this?

312
00:34:22,741 --> 00:34:24,497
Why do you have to do this?

313
00:34:25,103 --> 00:34:26,982
Where are you?

314
00:34:26,982 --> 00:34:29,053
Do come back now! Do come back now!

315
00:34:30,566 --> 00:34:34,001
I'm sorry.

316
00:34:35,599 --> 00:34:40,506
But I'm happy.

317
00:34:43,127 --> 00:34:45,474
I'm so happy.

318
00:34:45,474 --> 00:34:47,350
I'm so happy here.

319
00:34:48,755 --> 00:34:50,141
Did you say you're happy?

320
00:34:51,507 --> 00:34:52,968
How could you say that?

321
00:34:52,968 --> 00:34:54,898
Do you really think you're happy?

322
00:34:55,672 --> 00:34:57,939
I heard he has a fiancée.

323
00:34:57,939 --> 00:34:59,892
What about the man who likes you?

324
00:34:59,892 --> 00:35:03,350
How can you be happy when you're breaking
your parents' hearts?

325
00:35:05,027 --> 00:35:06,774
You'll get punished.

326
00:35:08,164 --> 00:35:10,230
It'll all get back to you.

327
00:35:12,602 --> 00:35:15,876
I'm sorry, Mom.

328
00:35:18,066 --> 00:35:21,052
Don't worry about me. I'm doing well.

329
00:35:23,594 --> 00:35:24,612
I am...

330
00:35:26,530 --> 00:35:27,989
at the farm.

331
00:35:30,930 --> 00:35:33,317
I called you to let you know
that I'm doing well.

332
00:35:34,922 --> 00:35:35,922
Mom.

333
00:35:36,289 --> 00:35:37,830
Are you at the farm?

334
00:35:37,830 --> 00:35:40,850
How could you go there?

335
00:35:49,427 --> 00:35:51,370
Do you really think you're happy?

336
00:35:52,533 --> 00:35:56,113
How can you be happy
when you're breaking...

337
00:35:56,113 --> 00:35:57,844
your parents' hearts?

338
00:35:59,737 --> 00:36:01,141
You'll get punished.

339
00:36:02,274 --> 00:36:04,237
It'll all get back to you.

340
00:36:25,286 --> 00:36:26,289
Eun Seo.

341
00:36:27,176 --> 00:36:28,176
What's wrong?

342
00:36:29,110 --> 00:36:30,110
Stay still.

343
00:36:34,223 --> 00:36:35,617
Sit.

344
00:36:35,617 --> 00:36:37,109
- Are you all right?
- Yes.

345
00:36:37,109 --> 00:36:39,364
Jun Seo, I'm fine.

346
00:36:39,906 --> 00:36:42,157
Stay still. Lean your head back.

347
00:37:03,674 --> 00:37:04,702
Are you all right?

348
00:37:05,434 --> 00:37:06,643
Did it stop?

349
00:37:07,337 --> 00:37:08,677
Yes, it stopped.

350
00:37:12,145 --> 00:37:14,371
- Were you scared?
- Yes, I was.

351
00:37:15,888 --> 00:37:17,362
I should be sick all the time, then.

352
00:37:18,248 --> 00:37:19,248
What?

353
00:37:20,237 --> 00:37:24,221
I would like you to rush toward me
with concern.

354
00:37:29,427 --> 00:37:30,502
Isn't this a cake?

355
00:37:31,859 --> 00:37:33,173
So you went out to buy this?

356
00:37:33,971 --> 00:37:35,000
Yes.

357
00:37:39,932 --> 00:37:41,462
Did something happen to you?

358
00:37:42,667 --> 00:37:43,701
No.

359
00:37:46,236 --> 00:37:47,662
I'm just happy.

360
00:37:49,611 --> 00:37:51,430
I'm scared because I'm so happy.

361
00:37:53,738 --> 00:37:54,894
I'm silly, right?

362
00:37:59,307 --> 00:38:01,116
Yes, you are.

363
00:38:09,609 --> 00:38:12,282
This is what you asked to be
delivered by today.

364
00:38:12,282 --> 00:38:14,390
And what about
the dinner reservation for tonight?

365
00:38:15,652 --> 00:38:17,061
Cancel it, please.

366
00:38:17,061 --> 00:38:18,215
Yes, I will.

367
00:38:51,202 --> 00:38:52,348
Hello.

368
00:38:57,025 --> 00:38:58,100
Where is she?

369
00:39:01,072 --> 00:39:02,306
I am sorry.

370
00:39:04,072 --> 00:39:05,574
The wretch must be out of her mind.

371
00:39:05,574 --> 00:39:07,412
That is the only reason she's doing this.

372
00:39:08,254 --> 00:39:12,814
I want to go and drag her here right now.

373
00:39:12,814 --> 00:39:16,510
But I haven't worked for a while,
so I don't have any money.

374
00:39:16,510 --> 00:39:17,761
Also, I'm hungry...

375
00:39:18,455 --> 00:39:19,539
Where is she?

376
00:39:21,935 --> 00:39:23,850
I know I shouldn't do this.

377
00:39:26,478 --> 00:39:27,980
I...

378
00:39:27,980 --> 00:39:31,645
I wouldn't do this if I had a decent job.

379
00:39:31,645 --> 00:39:32,769
Where is she?

380
00:39:51,363 --> 00:39:53,060
Cheers.

381
00:40:08,562 --> 00:40:09,869
Happy birthday.

382
00:40:09,869 --> 00:40:10,986
Thanks.

383
00:40:10,986 --> 00:40:12,430
Have some cake.

384
00:40:18,353 --> 00:40:19,371
Let's eat.

385
00:40:48,071 --> 00:40:49,426
Let's go back tomorrow.

386
00:40:57,080 --> 00:40:59,626
Yes, let's go back.

387
00:41:03,145 --> 00:41:04,211
Are you sad?

388
00:41:06,624 --> 00:41:08,187
There's no need to be sad.

389
00:41:10,145 --> 00:41:15,348
We go back tomorrow
and tell them we're getting married.

390
00:41:16,912 --> 00:41:18,883
Then we can come back here
after getting married.

391
00:41:27,778 --> 00:41:28,811
Don't you want to?

392
00:41:33,745 --> 00:41:35,099
When we go back...

393
00:41:35,880 --> 00:41:37,010
It'll be all right.

394
00:41:38,367 --> 00:41:39,740
I'll take care of everything.

395
00:41:42,081 --> 00:41:43,908
You don't need to do anything.

396
00:41:47,056 --> 00:41:50,236
Don't listen to anyone,
and don't see anything.

397
00:41:52,680 --> 00:41:55,546
You should see and listen to only me.

398
00:41:57,801 --> 00:41:59,107
That is all you need to do.

399
00:42:03,729 --> 00:42:04,954
Don't do that.

400
00:42:07,201 --> 00:42:08,723
You don't need to do that.

401
00:42:11,993 --> 00:42:13,572
Let's not do that, Jun Seo.

402
00:42:15,968 --> 00:42:18,674
I have had enough now.

403
00:42:20,544 --> 00:42:23,755
It's enough for me to be with you
right now.

404
00:42:24,856 --> 00:42:26,050
Don't do that.

405
00:42:30,705 --> 00:42:31,946
If you do that...

406
00:42:33,759 --> 00:42:37,106
to my mom, your mom and dad,

407
00:42:38,391 --> 00:42:40,738
and other people, it won't be proper.

408
00:42:43,031 --> 00:42:45,283
We can't do that
just to make ourselves happy.

409
00:42:49,614 --> 00:42:54,419
I have had enough,
so let's not do that, Jun Seo.

410
00:42:55,455 --> 00:42:56,873
It's not enough for me.

411
00:43:00,006 --> 00:43:02,585
It wouldn't be enough
even if I lived with you forever.

412
00:43:08,352 --> 00:43:09,498
What can I do?

413
00:45:27,316 --> 00:45:28,919
- It's getting colder.
- Yes.

414
00:45:33,620 --> 00:45:34,656
Tae Seok.

415
00:46:20,397 --> 00:46:21,830
Eun Seo and I...

416
00:46:25,414 --> 00:46:26,541
are getting married.

417
00:46:28,869 --> 00:46:29,982
Yoon Jun Seo.

418
00:46:33,332 --> 00:46:34,592
Think about it again.

419
00:46:35,573 --> 00:46:36,927
You and Eun Seo can't get married.

420
00:46:39,787 --> 00:46:40,864
No.

421
00:46:42,332 --> 00:46:45,976
Your parents and Yu Mi.

422
00:46:47,188 --> 00:46:48,662
You can't leave them.

423
00:46:50,268 --> 00:46:53,639
Even if you do it now,
you're not that kind of a person.

424
00:46:55,110 --> 00:46:56,423
You're not capable of it.

425
00:46:58,813 --> 00:46:59,991
Yoon Jun Seo.

426
00:47:01,364 --> 00:47:04,668
How could you do that?

427
00:47:04,668 --> 00:47:06,211
How could you do that to Yu Mi?

428
00:47:06,211 --> 00:47:08,126
How could you do that to your parents?

429
00:47:11,291 --> 00:47:12,361
How...

430
00:47:14,870 --> 00:47:16,370
How could you do that to me?

431
00:47:23,013 --> 00:47:24,013
I'm sorry.

432
00:47:27,638 --> 00:47:29,017
I'm sorry, Tae Seok.

433
00:47:34,975 --> 00:47:36,641
But Eun Seo and I...

434
00:47:42,437 --> 00:47:43,640
We'll get married.

435
00:47:45,182 --> 00:47:46,344
Let's go back in the morning.

436
00:48:33,137 --> 00:48:34,164
Take the front seat.

437
00:48:36,064 --> 00:48:37,308
I said, take the front seat.

438
00:48:38,098 --> 00:48:39,941
You don't get to sit together
in front of me.

439
00:49:06,755 --> 00:49:07,973
I'll get it.

440
00:49:13,987 --> 00:49:15,839
It is Yu Mi's mother.

441
00:49:15,839 --> 00:49:18,852
- Mom, why are you doing this?
- Let me go.

442
00:49:18,852 --> 00:49:19,882
Mom.

443
00:49:38,692 --> 00:49:44,040
I have no words to say to you.

444
00:49:46,508 --> 00:49:48,806
What is wrong with your family?

445
00:49:49,940 --> 00:49:52,733
How could he run away with a girl
who is almost his sister?

446
00:49:52,733 --> 00:49:54,531
Mom.

447
00:49:54,531 --> 00:49:56,184
Don't say anything.

448
00:49:56,184 --> 00:49:57,315
I am sorry.

449
00:49:57,999 --> 00:50:00,775
I trusted Professor Yoon.

450
00:50:00,775 --> 00:50:02,541
That is why I let Yu Mi date Jun Seo.

451
00:50:03,471 --> 00:50:05,194
How could you do this to us?

452
00:50:06,279 --> 00:50:08,537
You shouldn't have let them
get engaged, then.

453
00:50:11,000 --> 00:50:12,651
They will be back.

454
00:50:13,719 --> 00:50:16,591
I promise you they will be back.

455
00:50:16,591 --> 00:50:17,978
Please wait for them.

456
00:50:17,978 --> 00:50:19,204
And what if they are back?

457
00:50:20,513 --> 00:50:22,460
Do you think we can leave this behind us?

458
00:50:23,489 --> 00:50:26,067
We will break off their engagement.

459
00:50:26,067 --> 00:50:28,803
Mom, what are you doing?

460
00:50:29,465 --> 00:50:32,624
I can't live without Jun Seo. I can't.

461
00:50:32,624 --> 00:50:34,249
Keep yourself together.

462
00:50:34,249 --> 00:50:38,060
Mom, do you want to see me die?

463
00:50:39,872 --> 00:50:41,968
How could you...

464
00:50:41,968 --> 00:50:45,515
How could you do this?

465
00:50:46,521 --> 00:50:47,643
We are sorry.

466
00:50:48,185 --> 00:50:49,437
We are sorry.

467
00:50:57,954 --> 00:50:59,056
Eun Seo.

468
00:50:59,572 --> 00:51:00,875
Jun Seo.

469
00:51:00,875 --> 00:51:04,485
Jun Seo, you.

470
00:51:06,629 --> 00:51:07,733
Yoon Jun Seo.

471
00:51:19,443 --> 00:51:20,502
We are sorry.

472
00:51:23,252 --> 00:51:24,654
We...

473
00:51:28,563 --> 00:51:29,789
will get married.

474
00:51:40,379 --> 00:51:41,647
Jun Seo.

475
00:52:01,837 --> 00:52:03,137
Get out, Eun Seo.

476
00:52:04,039 --> 00:52:05,039
Eun Seo.

477
00:52:05,839 --> 00:52:08,141
Haven't you ever loved me,
not even for a little bit?

478
00:52:08,141 --> 00:52:09,141
I'm sorry.

479
00:52:11,068 --> 00:52:12,528
Don't forgive me.

480
00:52:13,484 --> 00:52:14,992
Please don't forgive me.

481
00:52:16,059 --> 00:52:17,126
I'm sorry.

482
00:52:18,043 --> 00:52:20,015
There is nothing I can do but this, Yu Mi.

483
00:52:21,691 --> 00:52:23,493
It's fine, Choi Eun Seo.

484
00:52:23,493 --> 00:52:25,551
You can live the way you live.

485
00:52:25,551 --> 00:52:28,809
I'll live the way I do.

486
00:52:29,799 --> 00:52:30,799
What?

487
00:52:31,542 --> 00:52:34,456
Is she still alive? Right?
